** Probe: a keyword written one column early (TITLETWO in columns 2-9).
** pyaermod's reader is whitespace-tolerant; this records what AERMOD does.
** AERMOD said: OU E100 Invalid Pathway 'S'. Columns 1-2 are the pathway
** field, so ' SUMMFILE' is read as pathway 'S'. Keywords must start in
** column 4 (three leading blanks), which is what pyaermod's writer emits.
CO STARTING
   TITLEONE  oracle 19: keyword starting in column 2
   MODELOPT  CONC  FLAT
   AVERTIME  1  24
   POLLUTID  SO2
   RUNORNOT  NOT
   ERRORFIL  19_keyword_in_column_2.err
CO FINISHED

SO STARTING
   LOCATION  STACK1  POINT  0.0  0.0  0.0
   SRCPARAM  STACK1  500.0  65.00  425.  15.0  5.
   SRCGROUP  ALL
SO FINISHED

RE STARTING
   DISCCART  500.  500.  0.
RE FINISHED

ME STARTING
   SURFFILE  AERMET2.SFC
   PROFFILE  AERMET2.PFL
   SURFDATA  14735  1988  ALBANY,NY
   UAIRDATA  14735  1988  ALBANY,NY
   PROFBASE  0.0  METERS
ME FINISHED

OU STARTING
   RECTABLE  ALLAVE  FIRST
 SUMMFILE  probe19.sum
OU FINISHED
